co, Palo Alto and Napa all went red? \n\nWhat if Muslim communities went all red? Dearborn? Detroit? How about inner city Baltimore? Would Democrats believe it wasn't fraud? The media would not question? \n\nWhite Republicans voting for communists & radical Muslims to punish Trump is like a sudden shift by every black voter in NYC, LA, Detroit, Baltimore & Chicago voting red. You'd believe that? \n\nSorry, what happened Tuesday night is not possible. Texas? Kansas? Mississippi? Ohio? All of them changed everything 2 years after a Trump landslide because of a war with 20 US deaths? More Americans are shot on a Saturday in Chicago! \n\nTrump secured the border and deported 3 million illegals. Result? Lowest murder & crime rates in 100 years. \n\nHigh Prices? High gas? Much higher prices under Biden. Higher gas prices under Biden w/out a war or tariffs. \n\nBad economy? Obama produced worst economy since Great Depression. Businesses closed by millions, half of Vegas boarded up, all-time record Americans on welfare, food stamps & disability. But he won re-election. \n\nIn Michigan white Republicans voted for a Muslim Brotherhood radical who wants Sharia Law to protest high prices caused 90% by Biden? \n\nRed rural districts in Texas's voted for an effeminate radical weirdo who believes \"God is non-binary?\" Gave him more votes in midterm election than Kamala in Presidential year. Really? \n\nSomething smells rotten. This is \"Twilight Zone.\" This is not possible. Someone thinks we're all idiots. \n\nPresident Trump, are you listening? We are being played.", "author": "GenWashington", "created": 1793966628063, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Greenhills", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Email thread from a family member: I believ all true about the insurrection of the DEMs to corrupt and steal elections", "last_comment_created": 1793972502160, "content": "<p>21 states, every county turned BLUE... So let's ask a few simple questions. If bluest states in America - California, NY, NJ, CT, Rhode Island, Mass, Illinois, Maryland, DC, Oregon, Washington- suddenly ALL turned RED...would it seem realistic? If every county in Oregon went red, would anyone believe it?</p>\n<p>If Mass voted red by 1 million votes, would media question it?</p>\n<p>If NYC went red would anyone accept it was &quot;poor candidates, bad president, wrong war, high prices?&quot; Really?</p>\n<p>What if LA, San Francisco, Palo Alto and Napa all went red?</p>\n<p>What if Muslim communities went all red? Dearborn? Detroit? How about inner city Baltimore? Would Democrats believe it wasn't fraud? The media would not question?</p>\n<p>White Republicans voting for communists &amp; radical Muslims to punish Trump is like a sudden shift by every black voter in NYC, LA, Detroit, Baltimore &amp; Chicago voting red. You'd believe that?</p>\n<p>Sorry, what happened Tuesday night is not possible. Texas? Kansas? Mississippi? Ohio? All of them changed everything 2 years after a Trump landslide because of a war with 20 US deaths? More Americans are shot on a Saturday in Chicago!</p>\n<p>Trump secured the border and deported 3 million illegals. Result? Lowest murder &amp; crime rates in 100 years.</p>\n<p>High Prices? High gas? Much higher prices under Biden. Higher gas prices under Biden w/out a war or tariffs.</p>\n<p>Bad economy? Obama produced worst economy since Great Depression. Businesses closed by millions, half of Vegas boarded up, all-time record Americans on welfare, food stamps &amp; disability. But he won re-election.</p>\n<p>In Michigan white Republicans voted for a Muslim Brotherhood radical who wants Sharia Law to protest high prices caused 90% by Biden?</p>\n<p>Red rural districts in Texas's voted for an effeminate radical weirdo who believes &quot;God is non-binary?&quot; Gave him more votes in midterm election than Kamala in Presidential year. Really?</p>\n<p>Something smells rotten. This is &quot;Twilight Zone.&quot; This is not possible. Someone thinks we're all idiots.</p>\n<p>President Trump, are you listening? We are being played.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 9, "score_up": 51, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}